<title>UK: Goshawk bid values Matheson at 34.99 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Goshawk bid values Matheson at 34.99 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goshawk Insurance Holdings Plc said on Friday that it has made a recommended offer for Matheson Lloyd's Investment Trust Plc, which values the investment trust at around 34.99 million stg.</p>
</text>
